WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 16=

02:13.700 --> 02:14.140
Your Highness.

02:15.300 --> 02:15.860
The ground is cold.

02:19.300 --> 02:20.110
Why are you here?

02:35.620 --> 02:36.900
Let me keep you company.

02:38.460 --> 02:39.020
Two people

02:40.140 --> 02:41.140
are warmer than one.

02:55.550 --> 02:57.580
We went through so much to get back.

03:00.830 --> 03:02.070
Chunhua can't die.

03:05.580 --> 03:06.390
Can you tell me

03:07.180 --> 03:08.070
what happened?

03:09.700 --> 03:11.300
We fled North Jing.

03:14.230 --> 03:15.830
Only Chunhua and I survived.

03:20.620 --> 03:21.620
The snow

03:22.070 --> 03:22.830
was so heavy.

03:26.230 --> 03:27.110
The road was endless.

03:30.020 --> 03:31.990
However far we walked, it never ended.

03:33.670 --> 03:34.110
Your Highness,

03:36.270 --> 03:37.390
you've left it all behind.

03:39.620 --> 03:40.900
Have I really?

03:58.180 --> 03:58.790
Your Highness,

04:00.510 --> 04:01.830
you're back in Sheng'an now.

04:05.860 --> 04:07.270
It hasn't snowed here yet.

04:08.420 --> 04:09.460
The snow in your heart

04:11.020 --> 04:11.860
should melt.

04:13.140 --> 04:14.270
But this moon

04:16.300 --> 04:17.620
is exactly like the one

04:18.710 --> 04:19.990
I saw in North Jing.

04:21.910 --> 04:23.380
On those snowy nights,

04:24.060 --> 04:26.060
we often saw a moon just like this.

04:28.260 --> 04:29.820
What Chunhua suffered

04:31.940 --> 04:33.500
was no different from what I did.

04:43.550 --> 04:44.030
Your Highness,

04:45.990 --> 04:47.500
you made it back safely.

04:49.060 --> 04:50.380
Chunhua will be fine, too.

04:52.620 --> 04:52.990
Right.

04:54.550 --> 04:56.150
She'll pull through.

04:59.260 --> 05:00.620
It's just a miscarriage.

05:03.150 --> 05:03.990
I lost

05:06.590 --> 05:07.670
so much blood back then,

05:09.790 --> 05:10.940
but I still survived.

05:12.030 --> 05:12.710
Chunhua

05:14.150 --> 05:15.300
will pull through, too.

05:18.710 --> 05:19.620
(But I don't want to!)

05:21.670 --> 05:23.670
(Even if I get what I want someday,)

05:25.230 --> 05:25.910
(in this life,)

05:26.620 --> 05:28.350
(I won't bind myself to anyone)

05:29.230 --> 05:29.740
(or marry.)

05:31.380 --> 05:32.740
(So that's why.)

06:01.860 --> 06:02.620
You should go back.

06:03.380 --> 06:04.030
I'll stay with you.

06:05.670 --> 06:06.860
We'll wait for Chunhua to wake up.

06:07.940 --> 06:09.790
There's no need for you to stay.

06:14.710 --> 06:15.550
If that's what you wish,

06:16.590 --> 06:17.590
I'll obey.

06:18.990 --> 06:19.910
But there's something

06:20.990 --> 06:21.910
I must say before I go.

06:26.110 --> 06:27.740
Today and every day after,

06:30.990 --> 06:32.470
I want to stay by your side.

06:36.300 --> 06:37.670
We'll always stand high here,

06:39.110 --> 06:40.790
gazing out at the city.

06:52.230 --> 06:52.670
Your Highness,

06:56.350 --> 06:57.150
I love you.

06:58.820 --> 06:59.420
Yan Shang,

07:00.940 --> 07:01.990
you scum.

07:03.590 --> 07:05.030
I'm actually starting to believe you.

07:05.860 --> 07:06.710
Believe me.

07:07.940 --> 07:08.860
And I believe you, too.

07:10.230 --> 07:10.860
Before,

07:14.380 --> 07:15.860
I never thought

07:16.910 --> 07:19.180
the word "love" meant much.

07:20.910 --> 07:21.910
I never believed

07:22.710 --> 07:23.260
anyone would

07:24.550 --> 07:26.380
give their life for those two words.

07:27.230 --> 07:28.420
It's strange.

07:28.462 --> 07:32.252
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

07:34.780 --> 07:40.670
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

07:42.180 --> 07:42.670
Your Highness,

07:44.710 --> 07:45.350
don't worry.

07:46.940 --> 07:47.620
Don't give up.

07:49.740 --> 07:50.910
So many people care about you.

07:51.790 --> 07:52.500
You're so wonderful.

07:53.620 --> 07:54.820
You deserve all this love.

07:55.990 --> 07:57.670
You're worth risking my life to protect.

07:59.590 --> 08:00.060
So,

08:01.230 --> 08:02.180
whenever it is,

08:02.430 --> 08:03.690
♪Soar with the wind♪

08:03.740 --> 08:04.590
don't worry

08:05.180 --> 08:05.790
or second-guess yourself.

08:05.970 --> 08:07.210
♪Burning bright as a song♪

08:07.260 --> 08:08.300
Just ask,

08:09.790 --> 08:10.860
and I'll tell you.

08:11.820 --> 08:12.300
All right.

08:13.670 --> 08:14.180
I'll ask you.

08:17.110 --> 08:17.910
Why did you

08:19.500 --> 08:20.860
take the blame for me?

08:21.940 --> 08:23.110
Because I love you.

08:25.590 --> 08:25.990
Your Highness.

08:27.350 --> 08:30.920
♪... if you're there♪

08:31.210 --> 08:34.650
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

08:34.850 --> 08:38.310
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

08:38.360 --> 08:41.010
♪If we can stay♪

08:41.060 --> 08:45.420
♪Let's return to the village
of our first meeting♪

08:45.580 --> 08:47.790
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

08:47.790 --> 08:50.000
♪- May time be free of pain
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

08:50.050 --> 08:52.510
♪You're the only one I need♪

08:52.860 --> 08:59.850
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

09:00.000 --> 09:01.790
♪Be my one and only in this world♪

09:01.840 --> 09:03.190
♪Be my one and only in this life♪

09:03.720 --> 09:05.780
♪My last untouched innocence♪

09:19.260 --> 09:20.990
The Zheng Xing case is closed?

09:22.500 --> 09:22.900
Yes.

09:23.710 --> 09:24.305
The Capital Prefecture,
Justice Ministry,

09:24.306 --> 09:25.990
Court of Judicial Review,
Ministry of Revenue...

09:26.190 --> 09:26.950
all their case files

09:27.740 --> 09:28.380
are here.

09:30.070 --> 09:31.020
Zheng Xing

09:32.500 --> 09:33.990
nearly ruined my grand plan.

09:34.990 --> 09:36.900
What a fool.
His arrogance got him killed.

09:38.740 --> 09:39.990
Sheng'an is a tough place to manage.

09:40.110 --> 09:40.900
I never imagined

09:41.380 --> 09:43.020
that a mere hunting ground

09:43.590 --> 09:45.660
would spark such a war of words.

09:46.190 --> 09:46.590
Zidu,

09:47.620 --> 09:48.540
I'll be counting on you

09:48.710 --> 09:50.540
to handle the hunting ground matter.

09:51.900 --> 09:52.660
You can count on me, sir.

09:53.470 --> 09:54.584
But lately,

09:54.626 --> 09:56.596
a bunch of officials
have been at it nonstop,

09:57.230 --> 10:00.020
arguing over Zheng Xing
wounding Prince of Jin.

10:02.110 --> 10:02.780
Officials?

10:04.350 --> 10:06.950
If they didn't argue all day,

10:08.070 --> 10:09.830
what would we pay them for?

10:12.620 --> 10:15.140
The real problem

10:15.500 --> 10:16.540
is that maid.

10:17.740 --> 10:18.540
Take her to the Yintaimen.

10:19.620 --> 10:20.380
Beat her to death.

10:21.020 --> 10:22.470
That should settle the matter.

10:25.310 --> 10:26.230
Rest assured, Your Highness.

10:27.190 --> 10:30.470
Miss Chunhua's pulse is steady.
She's out of danger.

10:31.070 --> 10:33.260
She just needs some rest.

10:40.900 --> 10:42.110
What about the child she's carrying?

10:45.620 --> 10:46.470
Both mother and child

10:47.380 --> 10:48.190
are safe.

10:51.900 --> 10:53.660
This... this is strange.

10:54.140 --> 10:57.190
She was beyond saving.

10:58.140 --> 11:00.590
How did she suddenly recover?

11:03.430 --> 11:04.070
Imperial Physician Huang,

11:06.380 --> 11:07.780
you've served here for your whole life.

11:09.110 --> 11:10.470
You know the rules

11:11.140 --> 11:11.740
of the palace.

11:12.740 --> 11:13.430
I do.

11:14.310 --> 11:14.860
I understand.

11:18.110 --> 11:18.740
Imperial Physician Huang,

11:19.900 --> 11:20.860
a healer's heart should be kind.

11:21.470 --> 11:22.710
And the kindest thing

11:23.190 --> 11:24.020
is to keep your mouth shut.

11:27.260 --> 11:28.190
Thank you, Your Highness.

11:37.590 --> 11:37.990
Your Highness,

11:38.470 --> 11:39.660
an attendant from Yintaimen is here.

11:42.740 --> 11:45.830
Your Highness,
you'd better settle this soon.

11:46.860 --> 11:48.540
The Investigation Office is swamped.

11:49.110 --> 11:51.470
They'll only wait two more days.

12:19.700 --> 12:24.180
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

12:24.180 --> 12:28.660
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

12:34.660 --> 12:36.700
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

12:45.070 --> 12:46.660
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)
Please leave, Your Highness.

12:46.990 --> 12:48.070
Lord Yu is busy today.

12:48.310 --> 12:49.070
He won't see uninvited guests.

13:00.700 --> 13:06.780
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

13:30.830 --> 13:31.380
Your Highness.

13:33.350 --> 13:34.830
Why so quiet now that you're here?

13:44.020 --> 13:45.190
What happened, Your Highness?

13:46.430 --> 13:47.230
You're scaring me.

13:48.900 --> 13:49.500
Chunhua...

13:54.140 --> 13:55.070
Do you want to live?

14:06.990 --> 14:07.620
So,

14:09.660 --> 14:11.230
even though I've done nothing wrong,

14:13.070 --> 14:14.190
I'm like a chicken,

14:15.500 --> 14:16.620
like a sheep,

14:17.990 --> 14:19.430
at their mercy to kill,

14:20.590 --> 14:21.830
just to give them an answer.

14:22.710 --> 14:23.310
Yes.

14:25.260 --> 14:26.540
To Yu Cheng'an,

14:28.860 --> 14:30.780
people who've lost homes and land
don't matter.

14:33.230 --> 14:34.780
Court gossip doesn't matter.

14:36.900 --> 14:38.430
Zheng Xing's death doesn't matter.

14:40.070 --> 14:40.660
You and I

14:42.110 --> 14:42.780
don't matter either.

14:52.260 --> 14:52.830
Chunhua,

14:54.620 --> 14:55.780
it's because you're insignificant

14:57.380 --> 14:58.860
that there's still a chance.

15:00.620 --> 15:02.470
Yu Cheng'an doesn't care about you.

15:03.430 --> 15:05.740
Yintaimen couldn't even be bothered
to send anyone.

15:07.020 --> 15:08.190
They've left me to handle it myself.

15:11.470 --> 15:12.470
I've thought of two ways

15:13.230 --> 15:14.500
to keep you out of Yintaimen.

15:15.950 --> 15:17.590
I doubt Yu Cheng'an will make a fuss.

15:19.590 --> 15:20.350
What are they?

15:23.190 --> 15:23.780
The first way:

15:24.900 --> 15:25.780
I'll find a way

15:26.590 --> 15:27.660
for Liu Wenji to take you away.

15:29.950 --> 15:30.500
A carriage,

15:30.990 --> 15:32.020
clothes, food, and money...

15:32.380 --> 15:33.190
I'll have it all ready.

15:33.740 --> 15:34.830
You must leave before curfew.

15:35.660 --> 15:36.830
But you can't return to Lingnan.

15:37.590 --> 15:38.500
You'd be better off in the Shu region.

15:47.540 --> 15:47.950
No.

15:51.110 --> 15:53.020
I can't drag him down with me.

15:58.380 --> 15:59.590
What's the second?

16:11.140 --> 16:12.020
Marry Prince of Jin.

16:13.540 --> 16:14.350
That will save your life.

16:18.740 --> 16:19.310
Why?

16:23.590 --> 16:24.860
Are you giving up on me?

16:31.710 --> 16:32.310
Chunhua,

16:34.540 --> 16:35.830
now Zheng Xing's death

16:37.310 --> 16:38.710
is blamed on Prince of Jin's injury,

16:40.190 --> 16:41.260
and Yu Cheng'an blames you

16:42.310 --> 16:43.620
for Prince of Jin's injury.

16:46.430 --> 16:48.110
The hunting ground sparked
public outrage.

16:48.900 --> 16:49.860
A powerful eunuch died.

16:50.350 --> 16:51.230
A prince was wounded.

16:52.140 --> 16:52.660
And in the end,

16:53.110 --> 16:54.310
it all fell on you.

16:55.660 --> 16:56.540
The officials have made you

16:57.590 --> 16:58.830
the femme fatale behind it all.

17:03.140 --> 17:04.100
We're trapped in a dead end.

17:05.780 --> 17:06.390
For now,

17:07.950 --> 17:09.780
these are the only ways I can think of.

17:17.580 --> 17:18.950
I don't want either.

17:43.860 --> 17:49.140
♪A daughter ventures forth,
in the name her father gave♪

17:49.950 --> 17:56.130
♪Into savage lands,
to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

17:58.180 --> 18:03.580
♪The fate is sealed,
a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

18:04.860 --> 18:07.630
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

18:07.630 --> 18:08.100
Your Highness,

18:10.710 --> 18:11.820
I'm a simple person.

18:14.340 --> 18:15.950
There's a lot I don't understand

18:16.870 --> 18:18.100
or see clearly.

18:21.780 --> 18:23.340
But now, I finally get it.

18:27.540 --> 18:31.580
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

18:31.710 --> 18:32.190
Your Highness...

18:32.190 --> 18:33.960
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

18:35.150 --> 18:36.740
We've suffered too much.

18:39.580 --> 18:41.580
Even if I die, I won't accept this.

18:41.622 --> 18:45.602
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

18:45.650 --> 18:47.800
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

18:48.060 --> 18:48.910
I finally get it.

18:48.952 --> 18:51.592
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

18:51.740 --> 18:52.630
No matter what,

18:52.672 --> 18:53.302
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

18:53.580 --> 18:54.470
however hard it gets,

18:56.300 --> 18:57.580
I'll survive.

18:59.820 --> 19:00.430
I know.

19:00.472 --> 19:02.292
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

19:02.340 --> 19:04.630
Living has always been
the hardest thing.

19:05.630 --> 19:07.100
Always enduring pain,

19:07.710 --> 19:09.540
swallowing your tears
and bearing it all.

19:09.780 --> 19:13.760
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

19:15.580 --> 19:17.230
I ask for nothing else.

19:17.272 --> 19:21.592
♪I'll guard my princess,
and keep her tears at bay♪

19:22.870 --> 19:24.340
Whatever happens,

19:26.950 --> 19:28.470
I'll always be your Chunhua.

19:31.470 --> 19:32.990
Please don't abandon me.

19:32.990 --> 19:35.910
♪You did no wrong, so why this pain?♪

19:35.910 --> 19:36.580
Chunhua.

19:45.060 --> 19:46.500
I'm not abandoning you.

19:48.500 --> 19:50.100
You're all I have left.

19:51.990 --> 19:52.950
I'm just

19:54.710 --> 19:55.910
too weak.

19:55.952 --> 19:58.022
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

19:58.260 --> 19:59.740
I failed to protect you.

19:59.782 --> 20:02.492
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

20:02.540 --> 20:04.840
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

20:05.090 --> 20:08.440
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

20:08.490 --> 20:10.180
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

20:12.360 --> 20:16.460
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

20:16.620 --> 20:19.610
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

20:19.660 --> 20:25.890
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers
bright as day for you♪

20:26.420 --> 20:30.290
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

20:31.390 --> 20:32.430
Don't cry, Your Highness.

20:33.690 --> 20:37.690
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

20:44.780 --> 20:46.020
Take me to Prince of Jin's residence.

20:51.140 --> 20:55.500
♪A tooth for a tooth♪

20:57.040 --> 20:59.170
♪A scar for a scar♪

21:00.460 --> 21:02.820
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

21:05.290 --> 21:09.500
♪Mourn the blooms of youth♪

21:10.780 --> 21:13.320
♪Mourn my bridal hair♪

21:14.360 --> 21:16.820
♪Dust veils the way back home♪

21:21.670 --> 21:22.300
Your Highness,

21:23.580 --> 21:25.670
I'm afraid there's nothing I can do.

21:26.260 --> 21:27.910
I can't prescribe anything new.

21:30.870 --> 21:31.470
Then should I keep

21:32.260 --> 21:33.060
taking this medicine?

21:37.260 --> 21:38.910
Forgive my bluntness,

21:39.670 --> 21:41.870
but I'm afraid your impotence

21:42.470 --> 21:43.870
isn't caused by a physical injury,

21:44.470 --> 21:45.630
but by emotional distress.

21:46.020 --> 21:47.630
Medicine can hardly help.

21:48.950 --> 21:50.609
I... I'll take a few more doses.

21:50.651 --> 21:51.841
Please treat me again.

21:52.870 --> 21:55.020
I'm afraid my medical skills fall short.

21:55.950 --> 21:56.540
Perhaps

21:56.950 --> 21:58.230
you should visit
the Imperial Medical Office

21:59.060 --> 22:00.670
for another opinion.

22:02.340 --> 22:03.300
Please forgive me!

22:03.670 --> 22:04.950
I'll take my leave.

22:05.430 --> 22:07.020
Who at the Imperial Medical Office
can help?

22:07.260 --> 22:08.580
Give me a name!

22:16.910 --> 22:17.670
Greetings, Your Highness.

22:30.500 --> 22:32.060
Why take this useless medicine?

22:35.340 --> 22:36.470
Let's try again.

22:36.990 --> 22:37.870
Give it a few more days.

22:38.230 --> 22:39.990
I think you should stop trying.

22:40.580 --> 22:41.780
It's been three years.

22:42.500 --> 22:43.479
Even when you were perfectly healthy,

22:43.521 --> 22:45.041
you couldn't father a child.

22:45.780 --> 22:46.390
And now,

22:46.740 --> 22:48.300
you should focus
on looking after yourself.

22:53.260 --> 22:55.300
I just hate that my father is so blind.

22:56.100 --> 22:58.950
With so many talented officials
and young royals at court,

22:59.540 --> 23:00.740
he weighed all the options,

23:02.190 --> 23:03.540
only to choose you!

23:04.820 --> 23:06.060
I've wasted my whole life for nothing!

23:08.470 --> 23:10.990
Your father wanted you
to marry the Crown Prince,

23:11.300 --> 23:12.950
but he wouldn't marry you.

23:16.820 --> 23:17.780
What did you say?

23:18.020 --> 23:18.870
Still dodging?

23:19.820 --> 23:20.470
Dodge this!

23:20.990 --> 23:21.670
Dodging, are you?

23:21.910 --> 23:23.100
Ow!

23:24.950 --> 23:25.990
It hurts like hell...

23:26.740 --> 23:27.990
Oh, my!

23:29.500 --> 23:30.950
Why did you hit my leg?

23:32.870 --> 23:34.260
(Prince of Jin's Residence)
Should we tell His Highness?

23:34.540 --> 23:35.479
I'm going back to my family home.

23:35.521 --> 23:36.651
Why should I tell him?

24:16.460 --> 24:18.900
(Prince of Jin's Residence)

24:19.740 --> 24:20.990
So what if I can't perform?

24:24.300 --> 24:25.710
I don't care one bit.

24:35.910 --> 24:36.500
Wait, that's not right.

24:37.300 --> 24:38.300
This is great!

24:40.190 --> 24:41.870
Even the Crown Prince won't
dare marry and have children.

24:42.950 --> 24:43.950
Now that I can't perform,

24:44.740 --> 24:45.780
I can't have children either.

24:47.060 --> 24:48.430
Lord Yu will stop keeping tabs on me.

24:49.950 --> 24:51.100
This is great!

24:51.710 --> 24:52.630
Just great!

25:28.230 --> 25:28.780
Your Highness,

25:29.870 --> 25:30.780
does it still hurt?

25:35.020 --> 25:36.540
Chunhua...

25:40.500 --> 25:41.820
You were badly injured,

25:42.670 --> 25:43.780
so I came to visit.

25:46.820 --> 25:48.060
Chunhua!

25:58.630 --> 25:59.300
All right.

26:00.430 --> 26:00.820
Don't cry.

26:02.390 --> 26:02.820
Don't cry.

26:18.910 --> 26:19.870
Stop already!

26:20.150 --> 26:20.929
Quick, get me back!

26:20.971 --> 26:22.081
I-I feel terrible.

26:22.150 --> 26:23.719
(Virtue, Diligence, Joy, and Peace)
My whole body aches...

26:23.761 --> 26:24.561
Mu Ti, don't go.

26:27.870 --> 26:28.740
I came today

26:29.100 --> 26:30.340
not to give you a hard time,

26:30.910 --> 26:32.020
but to congratulate you.

26:33.950 --> 26:35.820
Congratulate me? For what?

26:37.430 --> 26:40.209
Ow!

26:40.251 --> 26:41.211
Congratulations.

26:42.780 --> 26:43.990
Chunhua is pregnant.

26:46.820 --> 26:47.470
Really?

26:54.780 --> 26:55.950
I'm going to be a father!

26:58.910 --> 26:59.990
Am I dreaming?

27:02.710 --> 27:03.150
Ow.

27:05.100 --> 27:05.710
Wanyao,

27:06.500 --> 27:07.929
I'm barely hanging on.

27:07.971 --> 27:09.451
Don't tease me.

27:11.060 --> 27:12.190
It's true.

27:13.670 --> 27:14.580
I came today

27:15.100 --> 27:16.430
to ask you

27:17.230 --> 27:18.740
what you plan to do about Chunhua.

27:21.100 --> 27:22.430
Tell me what to do.

27:22.820 --> 27:23.710
Bring her into your household,

27:24.060 --> 27:24.910
make her a secondary consort,

27:25.670 --> 27:26.820
and record her in the royal registry.

27:34.260 --> 27:35.300
What...

27:36.430 --> 27:38.430
Wh-What now?

27:38.870 --> 27:39.470
Mu Ti,

27:40.780 --> 27:43.470
Chunhua is my most trusted maid.

27:45.260 --> 27:46.710
Take good care of her.

27:47.260 --> 27:48.870
Don't let anything happen to her.

27:50.430 --> 27:51.500
If I find out

27:52.100 --> 27:53.540
you've mistreated her...

27:54.710 --> 27:56.340
You have my word.

27:57.500 --> 28:00.190
I may be useless at everything

28:00.390 --> 28:01.630
and never have enough to eat,

28:01.870 --> 28:02.390
but

28:02.780 --> 28:04.630
I'll take good care

28:04.990 --> 28:06.540
of my woman and child.

28:14.670 --> 28:15.190
Good.

28:16.580 --> 28:18.100
(Virtue, Diligence, Joy, and Peace)
Remember what you said.

28:19.990 --> 28:21.670
If you take good care of her for life,

28:22.150 --> 28:24.630
you'll always be my good brother.

28:25.500 --> 28:25.910
Then...

28:26.430 --> 28:29.020
I'll choose an auspicious date
to marry her.

28:29.100 --> 28:29.910
No need.

28:30.190 --> 28:30.950
It'll be tomorrow.

28:31.990 --> 28:34.390
Come to my place first thing tomorrow
to fetch your bride.

28:43.340 --> 28:44.150
Ow!

28:44.950 --> 28:45.279
(Princess Danyang's Residence)
Careful.

28:45.321 --> 28:46.171
Give him the flower.

28:46.230 --> 28:46.780
Give him the flower.

28:47.630 --> 28:48.540
Sweep it clean. Look.

28:48.950 --> 28:49.740
Sweep it up properly.

28:50.540 --> 28:51.100
Watch out.

28:51.580 --> 28:52.519
Get that spot swept clean.

28:52.561 --> 28:53.691
Tie the flowers tight.

28:53.733 --> 28:54.123
Excuse me.

28:56.150 --> 28:56.950
A little lower.

28:57.430 --> 28:58.950
- A wedding here?
- (A little more.)

28:59.780 --> 29:01.390
Is Princess Danyang getting married?

29:03.340 --> 29:04.670
Could it be Yan Shang doesn't know?

29:07.260 --> 29:07.710
A little more.

29:08.670 --> 29:09.060
A little more.

29:10.260 --> 29:10.870
Sir.

29:16.500 --> 29:18.500
You work at the Princess's residence,
don't you?

29:19.540 --> 29:20.540
Do you know Miss Chunhua?

29:21.230 --> 29:22.230
Please tell her

29:22.500 --> 29:23.500
Liu Wenji is here to see her.

29:25.580 --> 29:26.580
Who are you?

29:27.060 --> 29:28.230
Chunhua's getting married tomorrow.

29:28.470 --> 29:29.500
She can't just come out to see anyone.

29:31.500 --> 29:32.190
Tie it tight.

29:32.390 --> 29:32.950
Keep it straight.

30:07.580 --> 30:08.150
Your Highness,

30:08.950 --> 30:09.710
it's cold and damp tonight.

30:10.150 --> 30:10.950
Drinking will only harm you.

30:17.060 --> 30:18.150
Your wounds haven't healed.

30:20.430 --> 30:21.190
You should be resting.

30:22.100 --> 30:22.780
Why are you here?

30:25.580 --> 30:25.950
By the way,

30:26.470 --> 30:27.710
your friend Liu Wenji

30:28.670 --> 30:29.500
has been locked up.

30:30.500 --> 30:31.670
He caused a scene at the gate

30:31.820 --> 30:32.740
and tried to force his way in.

30:33.540 --> 30:35.340
I can't let him ruin Chunhua's wedding.

30:40.780 --> 30:41.870
Knowing Wenji,

30:42.670 --> 30:44.230
if he sees the wedding tomorrow,

30:44.540 --> 30:45.630
he'll only get himself into trouble.

30:47.340 --> 30:49.820
It's the best we can do for now.

30:51.100 --> 30:52.150
I just went to see him.

30:53.470 --> 30:54.150
I had nothing

30:55.020 --> 30:56.190
to say to comfort him.

30:57.020 --> 30:58.020
The way things stand,

30:59.540 --> 31:00.340
our fate is not our own.

31:02.500 --> 31:03.910
There's nothing comforting to say.

31:05.710 --> 31:06.990
How much longer

31:08.950 --> 31:09.870
must our fates

31:12.820 --> 31:14.340
remain in their hands?

31:21.190 --> 31:22.300
These hands of mine

31:23.820 --> 31:25.340
are useless in the end.

31:46.390 --> 31:47.150
Your hands

31:48.300 --> 31:49.630
saved Chunhua's life.

31:51.020 --> 31:51.910
You did the right thing.

31:53.430 --> 31:54.260
I'd have done

31:56.060 --> 31:57.150
the same.

31:59.950 --> 32:00.430
Yan Shang,

32:03.500 --> 32:04.470
all along,

32:06.100 --> 32:07.780
whenever I had to choose between evils,

32:10.190 --> 32:11.390
I always chose

32:12.950 --> 32:14.430
the path that let us survive.

32:15.990 --> 32:17.470
Even if we barely clung to life,

32:18.340 --> 32:19.910
even if we suffered disgrace,

32:21.500 --> 32:22.430
as long as we lived,

32:24.190 --> 32:25.580
we could always turn the tables.

32:27.780 --> 32:28.390
However,

32:30.500 --> 32:31.670
that was my path.

32:34.150 --> 32:34.870
And now,

32:36.230 --> 32:37.780
Chunhua has taken it, too.

32:45.100 --> 32:46.150
Chunhua is just like you.

32:47.390 --> 32:48.630
You're both remarkable women.

32:51.060 --> 32:52.100
Born into this place,

32:52.430 --> 32:53.340
surrounded by thorns,

32:54.190 --> 32:55.580
you two are braver than anyone.

32:57.470 --> 32:58.340
Even if the road to survival

32:58.950 --> 33:00.870
is more painful than death,

33:02.780 --> 33:04.150
she still chose to live.

33:54.500 --> 33:55.020
Chunhua?

33:57.580 --> 33:58.060
Chunhua?

33:58.540 --> 33:59.230
Chunhua, it's you?

34:01.820 --> 34:02.300
Chunhua?

34:04.100 --> 34:04.580
Chunhua?

34:06.100 --> 34:06.500
Chunhua?

34:07.190 --> 34:07.580
Chunhua?

34:08.350 --> 34:08.950
Is that you?

34:09.180 --> 34:09.540
Chunhua?

34:10.470 --> 34:10.950
Wait for me.

34:15.390 --> 34:15.750
Chunhua?

34:16.500 --> 34:16.870
Chunhua?

34:17.700 --> 34:18.500
Is that you, Chunhua?

34:19.910 --> 34:20.310
Chunhua?

34:21.310 --> 34:21.700
Chunhua?

34:22.140 --> 34:23.430
Chunhua, say something!

34:24.020 --> 34:24.430
Chunhua,

34:24.870 --> 34:25.430
is that you?

34:26.390 --> 34:26.790
Chunhua?

34:27.620 --> 34:28.270
Say something.

34:28.700 --> 34:29.100
Chunhua?

34:29.870 --> 34:30.540
Are you there?

34:31.580 --> 34:31.990
Chunhua?

34:34.830 --> 34:35.220
Wait for me.

34:45.750 --> 34:46.140
Chunhua?

34:46.660 --> 34:47.180
Chunhua?

34:47.750 --> 34:48.220
Chunhua?

34:49.830 --> 34:50.950
Chunhua, is that you?

34:50.950 --> 34:51.790
Say something!

34:55.220 --> 34:55.790
Chunhua?

34:56.700 --> 34:58.660
Chunhua, why aren't you saying anything?

34:58.910 --> 34:59.620
Say something!

34:59.830 --> 35:00.870
Are you out there?

35:01.350 --> 35:01.990
Say something!

35:02.910 --> 35:03.540
Tell me

35:04.500 --> 35:05.430
why you're getting married.

35:05.990 --> 35:08.470
Why are you marrying, Chunhua?

35:11.220 --> 35:11.990
Chunhua!

35:12.350 --> 35:13.220
Say something!

35:13.950 --> 35:14.580
Chunhua...

35:17.660 --> 35:18.580
Say something!

35:19.140 --> 35:20.390
What's going on?

35:20.950 --> 35:21.430
Why?

35:21.870 --> 35:22.750
Why are you getting married?

35:22.990 --> 35:23.580
Why?

35:24.180 --> 35:25.390
Wait for me, Chunhua!

35:26.020 --> 35:26.580
Chunhua?

35:27.430 --> 35:28.060
Why?

35:29.620 --> 35:30.180
Chunhua?

35:31.020 --> 35:31.750
Why?

35:32.390 --> 35:33.100
Chunhua?

35:33.142 --> 35:34.872
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

35:34.920 --> 35:37.520
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

35:37.570 --> 35:41.040
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

35:41.470 --> 35:45.630
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

35:45.860 --> 35:49.430
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

35:49.480 --> 35:51.540
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

35:51.590 --> 35:53.980
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

35:54.030 --> 35:56.970
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

36:05.140 --> 36:05.660
Chunhua.

36:06.910 --> 36:07.750
Please, I'm begging you.

36:10.020 --> 36:11.350
Just say something to me.

36:14.750 --> 36:16.100
Won't you forgive me?

36:17.000 --> 36:19.700
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

36:19.750 --> 36:21.100
It's all right if you can't forgive me.

36:21.142 --> 36:24.702
♪And break a heart that bears no blame?♪

36:24.910 --> 36:26.100
I just beg you to tell me

36:27.310 --> 36:28.540
why this is happening.

36:29.190 --> 36:32.660
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

36:33.180 --> 36:33.700
Chunhua?

36:35.580 --> 36:36.100
Chunhua?

36:37.170 --> 36:41.300
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

36:41.430 --> 36:41.950
Chunhua?

36:41.992 --> 36:45.725
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

36:45.767 --> 36:50.607
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

36:51.740 --> 36:55.730
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave♪

36:56.180 --> 36:58.770
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

36:59.640 --> 37:01.870
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

37:01.920 --> 37:04.190
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

37:04.680 --> 37:07.570
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

37:08.140 --> 37:11.700
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

37:11.750 --> 37:12.700
Does Prince of Jin...

37:12.742 --> 37:15.572
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

37:16.200 --> 37:17.530
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

37:17.580 --> 37:19.350
truly treat you well?

37:19.392 --> 37:20.882
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

37:20.930 --> 37:23.970
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

37:26.660 --> 37:28.620
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

37:28.670 --> 37:31.270
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

