37:59.860 --> 38:03.420
♪Distant memories rise once more♪

38:03.920 --> 38:07.660
♪Could we meet anew in another life?♪

38:10.490 --> 38:16.100
♪How sweet the spring,
how hard to leave♪

38:17.430 --> 38:18.350
He cried and shouted,

38:18.660 --> 38:19.700
without a break all night.

38:55.310 --> 38:56.100
Please, Mr. Fang.

39:11.500 --> 39:11.950
Yan Shang?

39:12.990 --> 39:13.430
Yan Shang!

39:16.990 --> 39:17.390
Yan Shang!

39:18.180 --> 39:18.540
Yan Shang!

39:19.350 --> 39:19.700
Yan Shang.

39:20.990 --> 39:21.620
Help me.

39:22.350 --> 39:23.500
I have to see Chunhua.

39:39.060 --> 39:39.620
Wenji.

39:40.390 --> 39:40.750
Get up.

39:41.430 --> 39:41.790
Get up!

39:46.100 --> 39:46.700
Wenji.

39:48.060 --> 39:48.790
I'm here with you.

39:52.060 --> 39:52.910
Eat something first.

39:55.830 --> 39:56.350
Yan Shang...

39:58.350 --> 39:59.220
I can't eat.

40:15.620 --> 40:16.790
I found them at your door.

40:24.100 --> 40:24.870
Chunhua was here.

40:26.350 --> 40:27.580
I knew she'd come.

40:28.660 --> 40:29.060
Yan Shang,

40:29.540 --> 40:30.310
I have to see her!

40:32.350 --> 40:33.081
- I have to see her!
- Wenji!

40:33.700 --> 40:33.999
Wenji!

40:34.041 --> 40:35.011
Why stop me?

40:35.500 --> 40:36.950
- I have to see Chunhua!
- Liu Wenji!

40:37.750 --> 40:38.721
- Come back!
- Let go!

40:39.310 --> 40:40.199
I have to see her!

40:40.241 --> 40:40.641
Wenji!

40:41.140 --> 40:41.500
Wenji!

40:46.830 --> 40:47.350
Wenji,

40:49.350 --> 40:50.310
if she could see you,

40:52.790 --> 40:54.140
why would she leave only these things?

41:09.660 --> 41:10.350
Is this

41:13.390 --> 41:14.830
really all we'll ever have?

41:17.060 --> 41:18.750
Chunhua has her own path to follow.

41:22.220 --> 41:24.350
Since she returned these things to you,

41:26.270 --> 41:27.220
can't you see?

41:34.790 --> 41:36.540
She's saying goodbye for good.

41:50.290 --> 41:54.280
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave♪

41:54.730 --> 41:57.320
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

41:58.190 --> 42:00.420
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

42:00.470 --> 42:02.740
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

42:03.230 --> 42:06.120
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

42:09.100 --> 42:11.020
Lift your feet gently.

42:11.500 --> 42:13.390
May you reach higher!

42:15.020 --> 42:17.830
For a thousand years,

42:17.872 --> 42:18.492
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

42:18.540 --> 42:21.140
may you be blessed!

42:30.830 --> 42:32.060
On this auspicious day,

42:32.470 --> 42:36.700
please enter the palanquin!

42:42.420 --> 42:45.820
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

42:48.540 --> 42:50.990
Lift the palanquin!

42:51.032 --> 42:54.782
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

42:54.830 --> 42:58.550
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

42:59.150 --> 43:01.990
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

43:02.720 --> 43:05.700
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

43:05.700 --> 43:06.180
Chunhua!

43:06.500 --> 43:06.870
Wenji!

43:07.220 --> 43:07.830
Wen... Wenji!

43:07.872 --> 43:11.422
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

43:11.422 --> 43:13.020
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

43:13.020 --> 43:13.390
Wenji!

43:13.580 --> 43:13.990
Chunhua!

43:15.430 --> 43:15.830
Chunhua!

43:19.310 --> 43:19.990
Liu Wenji!

43:20.620 --> 43:21.790
Face reality!

43:21.890 --> 43:24.480
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

43:25.350 --> 43:27.420
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

43:27.470 --> 43:29.900
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

43:30.320 --> 43:33.280
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

43:33.850 --> 43:38.080
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

43:38.350 --> 43:41.280
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

43:41.910 --> 43:43.940
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

43:43.990 --> 43:46.340
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

43:47.390 --> 43:47.990
Chunhua!

43:48.830 --> 43:49.580
Chunhua!

43:52.270 --> 43:53.180
Chunhua!

43:54.270 --> 43:56.870
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

43:56.920 --> 43:59.860
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

43:59.910 --> 44:00.430
Your Highness,

44:02.620 --> 44:04.580
won't you even see me off?

44:05.050 --> 44:08.620
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

44:08.670 --> 44:10.730
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

44:10.780 --> 44:13.170
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

44:13.220 --> 44:16.160
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

44:17.160 --> 44:24.020
♪Ask not how we've braved power's tides,
through fading grass and setting suns♪

44:25.440 --> 44:29.000
♪Distant memories rise once more♪

44:29.500 --> 44:32.740
♪Could we meet anew in another life?♪

44:32.790 --> 44:33.500
Chunhua!

44:34.470 --> 44:35.220
Chunhua!

44:36.180 --> 44:36.870
Chunhua!

44:38.310 --> 44:39.180
Chunhua!

44:46.500 --> 44:51.100
(Next Episode Preview)

44:51.220 --> 44:51.790
Who are you people?

44:51.950 --> 44:52.660
- Let go!
- Darling!

44:53.310 --> 44:54.220
- You can't treat her like that!
- Let go of me!

44:54.620 --> 44:55.620
Leave her alone!

44:55.662 --> 44:56.222
Let go!

44:58.470 --> 44:59.660
Hold his legs down!

45:01.270 --> 45:01.700
Wenji!

45:02.870 --> 45:03.270
Give it to me!

45:03.500 --> 45:04.060
Let go!

45:05.060 --> 45:05.870
Let me die.

45:09.401 --> 45:12.694
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

45:15.379 --> 45:20.295
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

45:22.489 --> 45:28.334
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

45:28.834 --> 45:34.060
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

45:36.829 --> 45:41.620
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

45:42.456 --> 45:48.535
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

45:50.336 --> 45:53.486
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

45:53.486 --> 45:55.134
♪Burning bright as a song♪

45:55.186 --> 45:58.910
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

45:59.288 --> 46:03.954
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:04.573 --> 46:08.614
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:09.105 --> 46:11.220
♪Not a single hour less♪

46:11.260 --> 46:18.206
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

46:18.969 --> 46:22.422
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

46:22.602 --> 46:25.747
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

46:26.186 --> 46:32.823
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

46:33.220 --> 46:35.258
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

46:35.258 --> 46:37.734
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:37.772 --> 46:40.241
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:40.445 --> 46:47.332
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

46:47.644 --> 46:50.915
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

46:51.220 --> 46:54.393
♪My last untouched innocence♪

46:54.717 --> 46:58.143
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

46:58.376 --> 47:01.601
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:01.932 --> 47:08.728
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:09.097 --> 47:11.159
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:11.160 --> 47:13.663
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:13.710 --> 47:16.048
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:16.279 --> 47:23.114
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

47:23.463 --> 47:25.081
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

47:25.211 --> 47:27.007
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

47:27.364 --> 47:30.381
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:30.421 --> 47:31.748
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
